  ["eq1","F",4,"R","Read: «En mi colegio hay chicos de muchos países. Nadie se burla de los demás y todos nos ayudamos.» What is true about the school?",["Nobody makes fun of others.","Most pupils are from Spain.","Some pupils are bullied.","Nobody helps others."],"The verb burlarse de means to make fun of, and nadie means nobody."],
  ["eq1","H",4,"V","What does “Hay que luchar contra el acoso escolar” mean?",["We must fight against bullying at school.","We must fight against school uniform.","We must fight against school exams.","There is a fight against school bullies."],"The phrase acoso escolar means bullying at school, and hay que means one must."],
  ["eq1","H",5,"G","Complete: Lo que me preocupa ___ la falta de igualdad en el trabajo.",["es","son","está","están"],"The relative lo que is treated as singular, so lo que me preocupa es means what worries me is."],
  ["eq1","H",5,"T","Which is the correct translation of “Many people have suffered discrimination because of their religion”?",["Mucha gente ha sufrido discriminación por su religión.","Mucha gente han sufrido discriminación por su religión.","Mucha gente ha sufrido discriminación para su religión.","Mucha gente ha sufrida discriminación por su religión."],"The noun gente is singular, so ha sufrido, and por gives the cause (because of)."]
