  ["wb1","H",4,"V","What does “Las redes sociales pueden afectar a la autoestima” mean?",["Social media can affect self-esteem.","Social media can improve self-esteem.","Social media can affect concentration.","Social media cannot affect self-esteem."],"The noun autoestima is self-esteem, and pueden afectar means can affect."],
  ["wb1","H",5,"G","Complete: A mi hermana le ___ miedo los exámenes.",["dan","da","doy","dais"],"In dar miedo the subject is what causes the fear: los exámenes is plural, so le dan miedo."],
  ["wb1","H",5,"R","Read: «El año pasado sufrí mucha ansiedad, pero desde que hablo con una psicóloga me siento mucho mejor.» What is true?",["The writer feels better since seeing a psychologist.","The writer still suffers from a lot of anxiety.","The writer stopped seeing a psychologist last year.","The writer felt better last year than now."],"The preterite sufrí puts the anxiety in the past, and desde que hablo means since I have been talking."]
